{"title":"New AI and economics podcast","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/918214607/0/marginalrevolution~New-AI-and-economics-podcast.html","date":1747149707000,"content":"<p>From Andrey Fradkin:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>Seth Benzell and I have been working on a podcast about the economics of AI called <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fempiricrafting.substack.com%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7Cd8849c160f714c7fb2f608dd919c5bbd%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638826823203954646%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=dRuf3p%2BTJDlCOtMNDHi00c3xOirSEfWQ0s0knQHJfPg%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">Justified Posteriors</a>, which may be of interest to you and your readers. We have episodes on topics such as the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fempiricrafting.substack.com%2Fp%2Fthe-simple-macroeconomics-of-ai&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7Cd8849c160f714c7fb2f608dd919c5bbd%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638826823203992229%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=k3lg5EqujFvxwVvq%2BxXs%2F4SYEfF0boO%2BK9guaHNF%2Bec%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">“The Simple Macroeconomics of AI”</a> and the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fempiricrafting.substack.com%2Fp%2Fclaude-just-refereed-the-anthropic&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7Cd8849c160f714c7fb2f608dd919c5bbd%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638826823204012264%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=LdMwpO5Brsx1%2FDV1hayQRkgXEDMaYj9p6efRf%2ByjlaA%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">Anthropic Economic Index.</a> The format is that we state our priors, read a paper, discuss it on the pod, and then update our priors.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/new-ai-and-economics-podcast.html\">New AI and economics podcast</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/918214607/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/918214607/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/918214607/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/918214607/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/918214607/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/918214607/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/new-ai-and-economics-podcast.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/new-ai-and-economics-podcast.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/new-ai-and-economics-podcast.html#comments\"><h3>Co